//! Reserved words of the two target languages.
//!
//! A name from the `.hdlc` file goes into the generated HDL as written. A
//! reserved word there makes the generated file invalid, so validation must
//! reject it. The parser crates keep their keyword tables private, so the
//! tables are repeated here.

